// word_end's while condition must re-check the character at e every
// iteration, so the composition of character_code_at and is_space is a function
// rather than a name computed once before the loop. step() (walktext.id)
// reuses it for the same check at the start of a word.
is_space_at(string text, int i) {
  int charat_v = character_code_at(text, i);
  int ok = is_space(charat_v);
} return int ok;
(" ", 0):(1)
("ab", 0):(0)
